abstract: >-
  An efficient model to predict conduction velocity changes
  in unmyelinated axons, based on "memory" where prior
  activity modulates subsequent action potential speeds.
  Incorporating linear long-term and non-linear short-term
  memory components, it predicts propagation speeds using a
  memory function.
